# Cursor Layer - Project Rules

This project provides AI orchestration tools for Cursor IDE.

## Project Structure

- `.cursor/rules/commands/` - Command workflows for Cursor
- `.cursor/rules/agents/` - Specialized agent definitions
- `src/` - TypeScript source code
- `dist/` - Compiled output

## Development

- Use TypeScript strict mode
- Follow existing code patterns
- Test all changes
- Update documentation as needed

## Key Principles

- Standalone - no external repo dependencies
- Documentarian approach - agents document, don't critique
- Efficient context usage - parallel agents for research
- Respect .gitignore - automatically exclude build artifacts

